# 4. THE APPROVED 5TOT BUSINESS MODEL

## 4.1 Individual Student 5-Good

There are five core criteria:

1. Đạo đức tốt.
2. Học tập tốt.
3. Thể lực tốt.
4. Tình nguyện tốt.
5. Hội nhập tốt.

Approved high-level flow:

Student
→ School preliminary review
→ School consolidated recommendation
→ City independent review
→ Committee official decision.

## 4.2 University of Da Nang

The following original institutions remain distinct:

- DUT.
- DUE.
- UED.
- UFL.
- UTE.
- VKU.
- VNUK.
- SMP.

They share:

`unit-udn`

Requirements:

- One shared School Review Unit.
- One common School reviewer account under the existing configuration.
- One consolidated recommendation list per season.
- One common School official decision document.
- One successful forwarding operation per unit/season.

Do not introduce intermediate University-level review.

## 4.3 Independent Schools

Each independent School Review Unit maintains its own authorized review scope and seasonal forwarding list.

## 4.4 City Review

Authorized City Reviewers work in a shared queue.

No mandatory individual assignment.

No Officer workload allocation workflow.

No ResolutionCase.

No ambiguous-case escalation.

Retain actual actor attribution and authorization.

## 4.5 Committee

The Committee records authorized official award decisions.

Do not invent:

- Formal voting systems.
- Meeting scheduling.
- Hearings.
- Questioning.
- Quorum.
- Meeting minutes.

Human Committee authority remains final.

## 4.6 Collective Student 5-Good

Collective applications use TT01–TT04.

They go directly to City.

They do not participate in Individual School preliminary forwarding.

